data: {"id": "62b7bf7f7c5e42fc-final", "run_id": "62b7bf7f7c5e42fc", "seq": 1352, "ts_ms": 1788435938484, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v stuck in ContainerCreating with Pending phase |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 状态 `Pending`，阶段 `ContainerCreating`，原因 `ContainerCreating` | 确定故障现象为 Pod 卡在沙箱创建阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 条件：`PodScheduled=True`，`Ready=False (ContainersNotReady)` | 验证 Pod 已被调度到节点，但容器尚未就绪，排除资源抢占 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | CPU Request: `5m` / Limit: `50m`；Memory Request: `8Mi` / Limit: `32Mi` | 提供调度资源配置上下文，资源量极低且配置合法 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` 值为 `1`；`restart_count` 值为 `0` | 确认容器未启动且无重启历史，与 K8s 状态一致 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. K8s 状态与指标高度印证：Pod 处于 `Pending` 且 `ContainersNotReady`，指标 `waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` 和 `restart_count=0` 证实容器进程从未被成功拉起。\n2. 排除资源竞争：`PodScheduled=True` 与极低的资源请求（5m CPU/8Mi Mem）表明节点具备调度条件，故障非资源耗尽所致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nMissing NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 查找网络配置失败 → FailedCreatePodSandBox (NoNetworkFound) → Pod 停留在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源**（名称：`unavailable-network`，命名空间：`aiops-case-05`）。\n- **证据支撑**：Pod 的 `ContainerCreating` 状态与 `waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` 指标 [证据#1, #4] 表明 Kubelet 在创建容器沙箱（Sandbox）时受阻。\n- **机制分析**：根据正式 RCA 逻辑，在 Pod 已调度（`PodScheduled=True`）且资源充足的情况下，卡在沙箱创建阶段通常指向 CNI 插件异常。此处具体表现为 Multus CNI 无法找到名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络定义，导致 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误（诊断标记为 NoNetworkFound），进而使得容器无法进入运行状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 48.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 48.7s (Evidence 40.7s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 80.054, "metrics": {"run_id": "62b7bf7f7c5e42fc", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 80.0700900554657, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 80070.0900554657, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 70378.84593009949, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 22825.